{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8643b2daaadda92f", "type": "tool_result", "content": "# GLM-TTS Technical Report\narXiv: 2512.14291\nAuthors: Jiayan Cui, Zhihan Yang, Naihan Li, Jiankun Tian, Xingyu Ma, Yi Zhang, Guangyu Chen, Runxuan Yang, Yuqing Cheng, Yizhi Zhou, Guochen Yu, Xiaotao Gu, Jie Tang\nYear: 2025 | Venue: \nTopic: tts_vc\nStatus: unread\n\nContributions:\n  1. An optimized Whisper-VQ speech tokenizer with fundamental frequency constraints and expanded vocabulary achieves high speaker similarity and low character error rate.\n  2. A GRPO-based multi-reward reinforcement learning framework fuses pronunciation, speaker similarity, emotion, and laughter rewards to resolve reward hacking and training instability.\n  3. Optimized LoRA fine-tuning achieves full-model-level performance by adjusting only 15% of parameters, significantly reducing data requirements and training costs.\n  4. A hybrid phoneme-text input scheme with a dynamically extensible dictionary provides precise pronunciation control for polyphonic and rare words.\n  5. A novel Vocos2D vocoder replaces 1D convolutions with 2D operations to improve frequency subband modeling and adapts to complex acoustic conditions via mixed singing data training.\n\nTags: TTS, TTS/架构-AR-LLM, TTS/功能-RL优化, TTS/控制-风格标签, TTS/控制-参考语音, TTS/功能-多说话人, TTS/功能-多语言, Vocoder, Vocoder/GAN\n===NEXT===\n2602.05207\n2406.02430\n2508.16332\n2601.03888\n2511.07931\n2601.22306\n2602.06602\n2508.16790\n2605.28618\n2509.14684\n2510.23541\n2603.27538\n2409.00750\n2510.12210\n2604.15710\n2510.13344\n2502.03128\n2601.09239\n2604.19330\n2509.14579\n===NEXT===", "is_error": false}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "39a64380-dcef-4470-b4e4-3045cb700a86", "uuid": "eed32294-74b8-4ff6-b9e0-7a72c240e827", "timestamp": "2026-08-04T20:49:09.616Z", "tool_use_result": {"stdout": "# GLM-TTS Technical Report\narXiv: 2512.14291\nAuthors: Jiayan Cui, Zhihan Yang, Naihan Li, Jiankun Tian, Xingyu Ma, Yi Zhang, Guangyu Chen, Runxuan Yang, Yuqing Cheng, Yizhi Zhou, Guochen Yu, Xiaotao Gu, Jie Tang\nYear: 2025 | Venue: \nTopic: tts_vc\nStatus: unread\n\nContributions:\n  1. An optimized Whisper-VQ speech tokenizer with fundamental frequency constraints and expanded vocabulary achieves high speaker similarity and low character error rate.\n  2. A GRPO-based multi-reward reinforcement learning framework fuses pronunciation, speaker similarity, emotion, and laughter rewards to resolve reward hacking and training instability.\n  3. Optimized LoRA fine-tuning achieves full-model-level performance by adjusting only 15% of parameters, significantly reducing data requirements and training costs.\n  4. A hybrid phoneme-text input scheme with a dynamically extensible dictionary provides precise pronunciation control for polyphonic and rare words.\n  5. A novel Vocos2D vocoder replaces 1D convolutions with 2D operations to improve frequency subband modeling and adapts to complex acoustic conditions via mixed singing data training.\n\nTags: TTS, TTS/架构-AR-LLM, TTS/功能-RL优化, TTS/控制-风格标签, TTS/控制-参考语音, TTS/功能-多说话人, TTS/功能-多语言, Vocoder, Vocoder/GAN\n===NEXT===\n2602.05207\n2406.02430\n2508.16332\n2601.03888\n2511.07931\n2601.22306\n2602.06602\n2508.16790\n2605.28618\n2509.14684\n2510.23541\n2603.27538\n2409.00750\n2510.12210\n2604.15710\n2510.13344\n2502.03128\n2601.09239\n2604.19330\n2509.14579\n===NEXT===", "stderr": "", "interrupted": false, "isImage": false, "noOutputExpected": false}}
