{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "chatcmpl-tool-a596b78d2db94577", "type": "tool_result", "content": "# Seed-TTS: A Family of High-Quality Versatile Speech Generation Models\narXiv: 2406.02430\nAuthors: Philip Anastassiou, Jiawei Chen, Jitong Chen, Yuanzhe Chen, Zhuo Chen, Ziyi Chen, Jian Cong, Lelai Deng, Chuang Ding, Lu Gao, Mingqing Gong, Peisong Huang, Qingqing Huang, Zhiying Huang, Yuanyuan Huo, Dongya Jia, Chumin Li, Feiya Li, Hui Li, Jiaxin Li, Xiaoyang Li, Xingxing Li, Lin Liu, Shouda Liu, Sichao Liu, Xudong Liu, Yuchen Liu, Zhengxi Liu, Lu Lu, Junjie Pan, Xin Wang, Yuping Wang, Yuxuan Wang, Zhen Wei, Jian Wu, Chao Yao, Yifeng Yang, Yuanhao Yi, Junteng Zhang, Qidi Zhang, Shuo Zhang, Wenjie Zhang, Yang Zhang, Zilin Zhao, Dejian Zhong, Xiaobin Zhuang\nYear: 2024 | Venue: \nTopic: tts_vc\nStatus: unread\n\nContributions:\n  1. We introduce Seed-TTS, a family of speech generation models capable of generating highly expressive, human-like speech with state-of-the-art performance in multiple evaluations.\n  2. We present a novel self-distillation extension of Seed-TTS for timbre disentanglement and demonstrate state-of-the-art performance in the voice conversion task.\n  3. We introduce a novel reinforcement learning-based post-training extension for Seed-TTS that holistically improves the model's performance.\n  4. We present a novel fully diffusion-based variant of Seed-TTS that achieves superior generation quality and demonstrates advantages in speech editing.\n\nTags: TTS, TTS/架构-AR-LLM, TTS/架构-NAR-Diffusion, TTS/功能-DiT, TTS/功能-RL优化, TTS/控制-参考语音, TTS/功能-语音编辑, TTS/功能-多说话人\n===NEXT===", "is_error": false}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "39a64380-dcef-4470-b4e4-3045cb700a86", "uuid": "a54c3e95-d9bc-4f78-80dd-d4c1156f088f", "timestamp": "2026-08-04T20:49:24.272Z", "tool_use_result": {"stdout": "# Seed-TTS: A Family of High-Quality Versatile Speech Generation Models\narXiv: 2406.02430\nAuthors: Philip Anastassio